  "richContent": "<p>发车记录</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【150】</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>目前红利共持有20份 = 富国中证红利 x 10份 + 易方达中证红利 x2 份 + 博时红利低波100 x 4份 + 易方达红利低波 x 3份 + 南方红利低波50 x1 </p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【S】</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>目前红利共持有15份 = 富国中证红利 x 5份 + 易方达中证红利 x2 份 + 博时红利低波100 x 4份 + 易方达红利低波 x 3份 + 南方红利低波50 x1 </p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>本次 换仓 为：先卖后买。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>提前预告，原文👉：</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>https://qieman.com/content/content-detail?postId=86089</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/A75886F4-D025-4D42-9F38-8E6E91905C1D.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/93DB9D70-4DD1-4761-A1A8-C12674392AAB.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/B170E5FA-9FD8-44A6-A46A-CBDA266803C0.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/F60DA871-2D01-4C98-B96B-C52ACEA0B72A.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/53A246AA-6220-4D3C-9349-8C65ED4736FF.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/89237CD1-79D6-4FF7-9154-1AB680505C5A.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/00647F8D-EB2B-44A1-BA3E-494241F123B8.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/DDBD1D21-D221-48EC-B682-AE80D9A47683.png\" />",
